# PPC - HOMEBASE handoff

- Read `HANDOFF.md` fully (newest entries first) before other work.
- Treat it as source of truth for live versions, open follow-ups, deploy rules, and file layout.
- Prefer local `wrangler dev` on `:8787`; deploy only when asked (`npx wrangler deploy`).
- Do not commit or push unless asked.
- Update `HANDOFF.md` at the end of meaningful work (short entry, newest on top).
- After absorbing context, briefly confirm what's live / what's open and wait unless the user already gave a task.
